column8:
Take control of the Himari, the young female wizard travelling across various ages to settle the balance in time across the whole world! 

Features:
Various levels;
A lot of abilities to learn;
Hardcore action gameplay, which won't leave you bored;
Control the time and space!
All villains are people just like you: learn what's the reason behind them turning into their current state, or just fight them without further ado;
Character leveling system;
Three difficulty levels;
Secret stuff and easter eggs.

Pigs don't fly? Well, actually they do! Hed is an adorable pig that requires a lot of your sympathy. Help Hed in reaching the destination by avoiding all obstacles and skilfully maneuvering his body. This game is a tribute to all the pigs that were consumed since the beginning of mankind. 

Key features:
- Pixel art retro graphics & arcade-style gameplay;
- Discover lots of various worlds and amazing settings;
- Enjoy relaxing music during your flight;
- Avoid dozens of strange objects during your journey;
- Reach the strange level in which you will find the answer to the most disturbing question: Why?

Knight Swap is a minimalist puzzle game based on the old chess problem of swapping knights on a board.

The goal in each level is to move the opposing knights to where the others are placed (and vice versa) using the features of the board.

- Designed for Knight Swap fans and newcomers alike;
- 50 originally designed levels;
- All the original Knight Swap features including: partial and complete rotations, teleportation tiles, and movable parts;
- New gameplay mechanics that take the original Knight Swap concept to a whole new level;
- Originally composed music to help you focus and relax while solving the puzzles;

Can you swap the Knights?
